  [PASS] Maxwell control: T_xx = -(E_x^2 - E^2/2)/4piG  (standard Maxwell stress)
  [PASS] deep MOND: T_00 -> (a0^2/6piG) y^3 > 0  (positive energy also on the MOND branch)
  [PASS] trace-free stress  T_zz - T_xx = -(mu/4piG) E^2 = -(a0^2/4piG) mu y^2  (O(E^2))
  coupling-term stress T_00^{AJ} (T=t, A=(V,0,0,0)) = 2*V*q*(-P_X(1) - 2*P_X_p(1))
  [PASS] the coupling stress is PROPORTIONAL to V (no V-independent piece): T_00^{AJ} = O(q n V) = O(n Phi/c^2), post-Newtonian
  (the clock's own stress 2P_X dT dT + g P supplies the O(n) Newtonian source; every V-dependent term is O(n V) or O(V^2))
  deep MOND, point source:  T_00^A / rho_phantom  = 2*G*M/(3*r)   [c=1]  ->  (2/3) G M/(r c^2) with c restored
  [PASS] mediator energy / phantom density = (2/3) G M/(r c^2): post-Newtonian, NOT Newtonian order

